          "value": "Needle cap component of type III secretion system (T3SS), possibly involved in calcium regulation of Yop effectors expression, which includes the export process. Interacts with FPR1 on host immune cells and mediates T3SS docking and Yop effectors translocation into the cytoplasm of immune cells, targeting them for destruction and enabling bacteria survival and replication"
        }
